INSERT INTO `ha_posts` (`post_author`,`post_date`,`post_date_gmt`,`post_content`,`post_title`,`post_excerpt`,`post_status`,`comment_status`,`ping_status`,`post_name`,`post_modified`,`post_modified_gmt`,`post_parent`,`guid`,`menu_order`,`post_type`,`post_mime_type`,`comment_count`) SELECT 1,NOW(),UTC_TIMESTAMP(),'<h2>Why is the drip line system a necessity in green onion cultivation?</h2>\n<p>Green onion (Allium cepa var. aggregatum) is a valuable and high-demand crop that exhibits rapid growth and high sensitivity to rhizosphere conditions. Under traditional methods, flood irrigation can lead to root fungal diseases and lateral stem decay, which directly impact <strong>the green onion yield per hectare using drip line systems</strong> negatively. The drip line system, by precisely distributing water and nutrients at the soil surface, creates ideal conditions for the formation of uniform, small green onions.</p>\n<p>The use of this irrigation method not only reduces water consumption by up to 40 percent but also decreases plant stress by maintaining uniform moisture in the root zone, thereby increasing the economic attractiveness of investment in the agricultural sector. Below, we examine the technical and practical principles of this method.</p>\n\n\n<h2>Key parameters in determining green onion yield</h2>\n<h3>The effect of planting density on production volume</h3>\n<p>One of the main factors farmers must consider is appropriate planting density. For green onions, the final spacing between plants should generally allow sufficient room for root system development without competition for light and nutrients. Higher densities are acceptable in light soil textures, while in light and heavy soils, reducing spacing benefits unit yield production.</p>\n<h3>Integrated fertilization and irrigation management (Fertigation)</h3>\n<p>Drip tape allows you to apply pesticides and mineral fertilizers directly with irrigation water. This method prevents nutrient leaching and optimizes the uptake of micronutrients such as manganese, zinc, and iron, which are essential for onion seedling growth. Overall, correctly implementing [onion seedling seed quantity per hectare](https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%85%D9%82%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D8%A8%D8%B0%D8%B1-%D8%AD%D8%B0%D8%B1-%D9%87%D8%B1-%D8%AF%D8%B1-%D9%87%DA%A9%D8%AA%D8%A7%D8%B1/) based on actual plant needs is the key to success.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/میزان-برداشت-پیازچه-در-هکتار-با-نوار-تیپ-تصویر-شاخص.webp" alt="میزان برداشت پیازچه در هکتار با نوار تیپ - تصویر 1"/><figcaption>crop yield per hectare drip irrigation پیازچه</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n<h2>Specialized sections: Root and soil moisture relationship</h2>\n<p>پیازچه is a plant with a complex and shallow root system. Drip tape irrigation should be designed to keep soil moisture stable at a depth of 15 to 20 centimeters. If moisture remains on the surface, roots grow shallower and dry out quickly during extreme heat. In this regard, understanding [water amount in pistachio orchards](https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%85%D9%82%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D8%A7%D8%A8-%D8%AF%D8%B1-%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%BA%D8%AA-%D9%BE%D8%B3%D8%AA%DB%8C%D9%87/) as a model for smart irrigation can inspire the optimization of πازچه irrigation systems, although the requirements of each crop differ.</p>\n<h3>Improving efficiency with proper flow rate adjustment</h3>\n<p>To increase final efficiency, the flow rate from the tapes and the main line pressure must be adjusted so that no water drops seep outside the root zone. <a href=\'https://navar-abyari.ir/%d9%86%d8%ad%d9%88%d9%87-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%db%8c%d8%b4-%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%a8%d9%87%d8%b1%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%aa%db%8c/\' target=\'_blank\'>How to improve drip tape efficiency and productivity</a> This requires a deep understanding of soil physics and system hydraulics. Reducing evaporation from the soil surface is also a hidden advantage of this system, leading to greater water savings.</p>\n\n<h2>Practical tips for scallion farms</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Auxiliary equipment:</strong> Using an appropriate filter to prevent dripping tape clogging is vital. Soil drainage complexities must also be reassessed before planting.</li>\n<li><strong>Irrigation timing:</strong> In the early growth stages, irrigation should be frequent with low volume. As the scallions finish bulbing, reduce the irrigation volume to allow the plants to reach harvest readiness.</li>\n<li><strong>Drainage management:</strong> Ensure that the tapes are placed in a straight line along the planting row. Any deviation will cause parts of the row to dry out and reduce overall yield.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For more detailed technical process information, you can refer to [Tape Drip Installation Steps](https://navar-abyari.ir/%d9%85%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%b1%d9%84-%d9%86%d8%b5%d8%a8-%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%aa%db%8c%d9%84/) to ensure the correct placement of the equipment.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/میزان-برداشت-پیازچه-در-هکتار-با-نوار-تیپ-کاربرد-عملی.webp" alt="میزان برداشت پیازچه در هکتار با نوار تیپ - تصویر 2"/><figcaption>crop yield per hectare drip irrigation green onion seedlings</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<h3>Is tape drip suitable for all soil types?</h3>\n<p>The tape drip system is generally designed for most agricultural soils, but in soils with high salinity or extreme acidity, chemical adjustments are required. In specific areas, using high-quality [agricultural tape drip connectors](https://navar-abyari.ir/%d8%a7%d8%aa%d8%b5%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a7%d8%aa-%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%aa%db%8c%d9%84-%da%a9%d8%b4%d8%a7%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%b2%db%8c/) increases the system\'s lifespan.</p>\n<h3>What is the difference between tape drip and standard drip for green onion seedlings?</h3>\n<p>Tape drip creates a moisture band, enabling simultaneous irrigation and planting, which is more efficient for larger green onion farms with compact, dense spacing. Standard drip is suitable for plants planted at wider intervals.</p>\n<h3>Best planting time for maximum yield?</h3>\n<p>Depending on the climate, there are autumn plantings for spring seedling production and spring plantings for autumn production. Selecting the appropriate seed type, such as [seedling yield per hectare](https://navar-abyari.ir/piyozcha-hosili-gektar-rohnomo/), can lead to significant differences in final yield.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/میزان-برداشت-پیازچه-در-هکتار-با-نوار-تیپ-جزئیات-فنی.webp" alt="میزان برداشت پیازچه در هکتار با نوار تیپ - تصویر 3"/><figcaption>seedling crop yield per hectare drip irrigation</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>Conclusion: The key to economic viability in seedling farms</h2>\n<p>The most critical element in successful seedling cultivation is the controllability of environmental and growth factors. Drip irrigation systems allow growers to deliver water and fertilizer exactly when and where the plant needs it. This precision directly affects the quality and quantity of seedlings produced, ultimately leading to an increase in <strong>seedling yield per hectare with drip irrigation</strong> outcomes.</p>\n<p>Additionally, studying articles such as [Mazandaran guide to crocus harvest per hectare](https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%85%D9%82%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D8%A8%D8%B0%D8%B1-%D8%B3%D8%B3%D9%86-%D8%B3%D8%B3%D9%86-%D8%B2%D8%AF%D8%AA%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86/) can provide a better perspective on comparing the performance of flowering crops versus allium crops. By adhering to technical principles and continuously monitoring the irrigation system, you can achieve sustainable economic efficiency.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Related articles:</strong> <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%85%D9%82%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D8%A8%D8%B0%D8%B1-%D8%B7%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%DB%8C-%D8%AF%D8%B1-%D9%87%DA%A9%D8%AA%D8%A7%D8%B1/">D985D982D8AFD8A7D8B1 D8A8D8B0D8B1 D8B7D8A7D984D8A8DB8C D8AFD8B1 D987DAA9D8AAD8A7D8B1</a>, <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/canola-yield-per-hectare-guide-iraqi-farmers/">canola yield per hectare guide iraqi farmers</a>, <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%87%D9%85%D9%87-%DA%86%DB%8C%D8%B2-%D8%AF%D8%B1%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%B1%D9%87-%D9%85%D8%B2%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%A7%DB%8C-%D9%86%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D8%AA%DB%8C%D9%BE-%D9%BE%D9%84%D8%A7%DA%A9%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1/">D987D985D987 DA86DB8CD8B2 D8AFD8B1D8A8D8A7D8B1D987 D985D8B2D8A7DB8CD8A7DB8C D986D988D8A7D8B1 D8AADB8CD9BE D9BED984D8A7DAA9D8AFD8A7D8B1</a></p>','Shallot Yields per Hectare with Tape Drip: A Practical Guide to Boosting Productivity','Identification of factors affecting onion bulb yield and the impact of drip and tape irrigation systems on increasing flowering volume and reducing water-soil stress.','publish','closed','closed',@resolved_slug,NOW(),UTC_TIMESTAMP(),0,'',0,'post','',0 WHERE @source_post_id IS NOT NULL AND @translation_id IS NULL AND @resolved_conflict IS NULL;
SET @translation_id=COALESCE(@translation_id,IF(@source_post_id IS NOT NULL AND @resolved_conflict IS NULL,LAST_INSERT_ID(),NULL));
