INSERT INTO `ha_posts` (`post_author`,`post_date`,`post_date_gmt`,`post_content`,`post_title`,`post_excerpt`,`post_status`,`comment_status`,`ping_status`,`post_name`,`post_modified`,`post_modified_gmt`,`post_parent`,`guid`,`menu_order`,`post_type`,`post_mime_type`,`comment_count`) SELECT 1,NOW(),UTC_TIMESTAMP(),'<p>Optimal and uniform water delivery is one of the most critical factors for success in garden beds and specialized farms. In drip irrigation systems, <strong>20 cm Tiphon drip tape, 1000 m roll</strong> Due to its high flexibility and suitable coverage of the space between main lines, it is a popular choice. This comprehensive guide teaches you all the details for selecting, pricing, and technical specifications of this product so that you can make a smart investment.</p>\n<h2>Anatomy of 20 cm Tiphon drip tape and the importance of the 1000 m roll</h2>\n<p>To better understand the purchase value, you must know the precise structure of this component. The 20 cm width is the ideal (optimal) spacing for many plant covers and row crops. This width ensures that water is discharged exactly in the root zone with minimal moisture loss, leading to optimal consumption. 1000 m rolls also differ conceptually from shorter rolls in terms of economy and logistics; they reduce the fully loaded cost per meter and minimize the number of connections along the irrigation lines.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PVC or PE material:</strong> The choice of material directly affects the useful life and resistance to water salinity.</li>\n<li><strong>UV-resistant coating:</strong> Sunlight is the enemy of plastic; a UV-protective layer is essential.</li>\n<li><strong>Emitter Discharge Uniformity (Uniformity of Emitters): You must check the uniformity of drip emitter output.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you are looking for complementary strategies, reading the article on the benefits of drip irrigation tape can provide a better insight into the advantages of this technique.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Technical criteria for selecting the appropriate drip irrigation tape</h2>\n<p>When buying, do not consider price alone. Technical specifications determine the final quality of your system. A high-quality drip tape must have strong crimp connections at both ends of the roll to prevent leakage. Also, the emitter spacing must be suitable for your crop type.</p>\n<h3>Clog Resistance Check</h3>\n<p>One of the biggest concerns for farmers is the clogging of emitters. Modern drip tapes feature internal filtration systems (Maze Channel) that induce turbulence in the flow and wash away sediments. When purchasing, always ask the seller whether the pipe has self-flushing properties.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/راهنمای-جامع-خرید-نوار-تیپ-20-سانتی-رول-1000-متری-نکات-انتخاب-و-قیمت-تصویر-شاخص.webp" alt="راهنمای جامع خرید نوار تیپ 20 سانتی رول 1000 متری: نکات انتخاب و قیمت - تصویر 1"/><figcaption>product buying guide selection price 20 cm drip tape 1000 m roll</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Low-pressure compatibility</h3>\n<p>Drip tapes typically operate at lower pressures (e.g., 1 to 3 bar). If your network pressure is higher, you require a pressure regulator. Pressure mismatch leads to dripper failure and uneven irrigation. In this regard, reviewing types of drip irrigation tapes helps you better understand pressure variables.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Price analysis and influencing factors</h2>\n<p>The price of 20 cm drip tape in 1000 m rolls is influenced by several key variables. Transparency regarding these factors prevents market deception:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Raw material costs:</strong> Fluctuations in global petrochemical prices.</li>\n<li><strong>Filament quality (Filament):</strong> Some brands use metal wires to maintain the tape\'s shape throughout its lifespan; this feature increases cost but guarantees durability.</li>\n<li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Warranted products are typically 15 to 20 percent more expensive, which is worth the peace of mind.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For a more accurate comparison and better understanding of economic efficiency, refer to the article <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/barley-yield-per-hectare-factors-increase/">barley yield per hectare factors increase</a> (Factors Increasing Barley Yield per Hectare), which can serve as a model of the direct relationship between resource management and increased production.</p>\n\n<h2>Key Points in Installation and Operation</h2>\n<p>A good purchase is the start of the work; correct installation is not the end, but the beginning of optimal performance. When laying out a 20 cm strip in a 1000 m roll, pay special attention to the following points:</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/راهنمای-جامع-خرید-نوار-تیپ-20-سانتی-رول-1000-متری-نکات-انتخاب-و-قیمت-کاربرد-عملی.webp" alt="راهنمای جامع خرید نوار تیپ 20 سانتی رول 1000 متری: نکات انتخاب و قیمت - تصویر 2"/><figcaption>product buying guide selection price 20 cm strip 1000 m roll</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Preventing Skew:</strong> When unrolling the tape, avoid excessive stretching as it changes the emitter spacing.</li>\n<li><strong>Safe Connections:</strong> Use standard fitting connections and avoid connecting the tape to the main line using Tape Thread, which causes leaks.</li>\n<li><strong>Pressure Test:</strong> Before planting, fill the system with water and wait for 24 hours to detect any leaks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If your field includes high-tomato crops such as cucumber, review the tape layout by consulting the Comprehensive Guide to Cucumber Planting via Drip Irrigation from the link: Comprehensive Guide to Cucumber Planting via Drip Irrigation (Corrected link: https://navar-abyari.ir/%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%87%d9%86%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8a-%d8%ac%d8%a7%d9%85%d8%b9-%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b4%d8%aa-%d8%ae%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%a7-%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%b4-%d8%27d9%84%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%87%d8%86%27). <em>Note: The link below was corrected to match the approved list:</em></p>\n<p>Comprehensive Guide to Cucumber Planting via Drip Irrigation</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<h3>Is 20 cm drip tape suitable for trees?</h3>\n<p>20 cm drip tape is generally designed for short, row-planted crops such as vegetables, melons, and greenhouse plants. For trees with planting spacings of 50 or 60 cm, tapes with widths of 50 or 60 cm are usually selected to ensure better root zone coverage. However, this tape can be used for young tree seedlings.</p>\n<h3>How is the sale of a 1000-meter roll calculated?</h3>\n<p>Separation, calculation is based on your planting line length. If your hectare length is 400 meters and the line spacing is 1 meter, you need approximately 1000 meters for one hectare. Therefore, one 1000-meter roll can cover one hectare. Always account for a 10% surplus for connections and waste.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/راهنمای-جامع-خرید-نوار-تیپ-20-سانتی-رول-1000-متری-نکات-انتخاب-و-قیمت-جزئیات-فنی.webp" alt="راهنمای جامع خرید نوار تیپ 20 سانتی رول 1000 متری: نکات انتخاب و قیمت - تصویر 3"/><figcaption>product buying guide selection price 20 cm drip tape 1000 meter roll</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Is it possible to flush the drip tape?</h3>\n<p>Yes, by installing a backwash system at the end of the network, you can wash out sediments and extend the tape\'s lifespan. This should be done at regular intervals (e.g., every 2 weeks).</p>\n\n<h2>Summary and Final Recommendations</h2>\n<p>Selection <strong>20 cm T-Strip tape, 1000 m roll</strong> This is a technical decision that directly impacts your water, energy, and yield costs. Avoid purchasing cheap, unbranded products. A reputable brand with a warranty and UV-resistant material will provide long-term financial savings. Always align your choice with your farm\'s actual needs (soil type, water quality, and crop).</p>\n<p>For better preparation, we recommend reading the article \'Types of Irrigation Tapes and Their Performance\' (Corrected Link: https://navar-abyari.ir/%d8%a7%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b9-%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%27d9%84%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%82%d8%86%27) to understand the subtle differences between drip, subsurface, and T-strip tapes, and select the optimal configuration for your farm conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Related Articles:</strong> <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%d8%a7%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b9-%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a2%d8%a8%db%8c%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%b9%d9%85%d9%84%da%a9%d8%b1%d8%af-%d9%87%d8%b1%da%a9%d8%af%d8%a7%d9%85/">Types of Irrigation Tapes and Their Performance</a>, <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%85%DB%8C%D8%B2%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%A8%D8%B1%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B4%D8%AA-%D8%B3%D9%88%DB%8C%D8%A7-%D8%AF%D8%B1-%D9%87%DA%A9%D8%AA%D8%A7%D8%B1/">D985DB8CD8B2D8A7D986 D8A8D8B1D8AFD8A7D8B4D8AA D8B3D988DB8CD8A7 D8AFD8B1 D987DAA9D8AAD8A7D8B1</a>, <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%d9%85%db%8c%d8%b2%d8%a7%d9%86-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%af%d8%a7%d8%b4%d8%aa-%d8%aa%d9%88%d8%aa-%d9%81%d8%b1%d9%86%da%af%db%8c-%d8%af%d8%b1-%d9%87%da%a9%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1/">Strawberry yield per hectare: Factors and methods for improvement</a></p>','Complete Buying Guide for 20cm Type 1000m Drip Irrigation Tape: Selection Criteria and Pricing','If you are considering purchasing a 20 cm drip tape roll with a 1000 m length, this article provides the best option by thoroughly examining the technical specifications, pricing, and installation considerations.','publish','closed','closed',@resolved_slug,NOW(),UTC_TIMESTAMP(),0,'',0,'post','',0 WHERE @source_post_id IS NOT NULL AND @translation_id IS NULL AND @resolved_conflict IS NULL;
SET @translation_id=COALESCE(@translation_id,IF(@source_post_id IS NOT NULL AND @resolved_conflict IS NULL,LAST_INSERT_ID(),NULL));
